## CQ-CL-13
@group client, title screen and pause menu
@commands With an unread marker (delete `config/creativecommon/changelog_seen.txt`), hover the book button, then Tab to focus it
@pass Bubble disappears while hovered or focused, "What's New" tooltip fully visible; bubble back when the mouse leaves
@fails Bubble still drawn over the tooltip: `ChangelogButtons` render hook not reached (check the jar time)
@draft no batch holds this row yet
## SQ-MG-16 | (server half) Old and Weathered Cardboard Box made only by washing; weathered box tags
@group C
@commands Full restart; look at a Wares package block, Wares cardboard box block and both items in JEI; `/give` and place a Weathered Cardboard Box and an Old Cardboard Box; wash a Dustrial Decor Cardboard Box in a Create fan, then wash the result; check JEI for any other recipe of the Old or Weathered box
@pass Wares boxes brown; Weathered box grey-brown with light tape, Old box keeps its original pale texture and name; the first wash gives an Old box, the second a Weathered box, and no crafting recipe makes either; weathered box mines with an axe at Dustrial-box speed, walking on it is soft-tier speed and it sinks slightly; no purple-black squares
@fails Path or namespace wrong: check `kubejs/assets/wares/textures/` and `design_decor/`
@jars creativecommon creativedelight
@from batches/r1113/c1_a1.qb
# ids: Old box = design_decor:cardboard_box, Weathered = creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box (Common item_dict),
# Dustrial box = dustrial_decor:cardboard_box
> zq makes design_decor:cardboard_box
waitlog \[zq\] makes design_decor:cardboard_box: \d+ 30
> zq makes creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box
waitlog \[zq\] makes creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box: \d+ 30
> zq rdetail cardboard_box
waitlog \[zq\] rdetail matching cardboard_box: \d+ 30
> zq tagsof creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box
waitlog \[zq\] block tags of 30
expect \[zq\] makes design_decor:cardboard_box: 1$
expect \[zq\] makes creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box: 1$
expect \{create:splashing\} -> 1 cardboard_box <- dustrial_decor:cardboard_box
expect \{create:splashing\} -> 1 weathered_cardboard_box <- design_decor:cardboard_box
expect block tags of creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box: .*minecraft:mineable/axe
expect block tags of creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box: .*blockrunner:surface/soft
look client half (textures, names, JEI, walking feel, sinking) stays open; the two makes lines are the splashing recipes only

